WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.392
Today we will use voice, space and roles to tell a story. Our work connects with

00:00:05.392 --> 00:00:06.365
other Ghanaian communities.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.421
Assign a speaker, listener and narrator for a short scene.

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:14.654
Practise lines with clear facial expression and turn-taking.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.671
Act the scene once and revise a confusing gesture. Compare your result with a second

00:00:20.671 --> 00:00:21.699
example from Ghana.
